          "docs": ">\n**The action-based autoresponder feature has been migrated over to marketing automation. Your existing autoresponders are\nnow converted into workflows. You can no longer create and update action-based autoresponders using our API.**\n\nThis method allows you to update an autoresponder. The same rules as in creating an autoresponder apply.\n"
